    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Set on an impressive and private 0.89 hectare (2.19 acre) site, this beautifully maintained four-bedroom detached bungalow offers an outstanding combination of space, comfort, energy efficiency, and convenience. Ideally located within walking distance of Mucklagh Village and just a 10-minute drive from Tullamore Town Centre, this superb family home enjoys the benefits of peaceful countryside living while remaining close to a full range of amenities, schools, shops, and transport links. Offering well-proportioned accommodation designed for modern family living. The home has been carefully upgraded and maintained, with recent rewiring and replumbing providing peace of mind for prospective purchasers. The sitting room features a solid fuel insert stove, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere, while the bright sunroom is enhanced by a pellet stove, making it a comfortable space to enjoy throughout the year. A significant feature of this property is its investment in sustainable energy benefitting from 20 solar panels together with a substantial 10kW battery storage system, helping to reduce energy costs and improve overall efficiency with Oil Fired Central Heating the property offers a practical and versatile heating solution for year-round comfort. The property also features a large detached garage that has been converted to a 1 bed self contained unit.\r\n\r\nOccupying an expansive 2.19-acre site, the grounds offer outstanding privacy and versatility. The property is accessed through two separate electric gated entrances, providing convenience and excellent accessibility. Outdoor entertaining is a particular feature of this home, with extensive rear and side patio areas offering ideal spaces for family gatherings, barbecues, and summer entertaining. A large wooden gazebo provides an attractive focal point and creates an additional sheltered outdoor living area that can be enjoyed throughout the seasons.The generous site also offers ample space for gardening enthusiasts, recreational activities, or those seeking a tranquil countryside setting with room to grow."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall\t\t2.48m x 5.78m\t \r\nBright and spacious entrance hall with tiled floor\r\n\r\nLiving Room:\t\t9.61m x 7.19m \r\nWood floor, solid fuel inset stove\r\n\r\nKitchen: \t\t4.48m x 6.96m  \r\nFitted kitchen, tiled floor. \r\n\r\nDining Room:\t\t5.37m x 3.42m  \r\nTiled floor, double door to rear patio\r\n\r\nUtility:\t \t\t2.86m x 4.05m.  \r\nTiled floor, plumbed for washer/dryer\r\n\r\nGuest W.C.:\t\t1.47m x 2.38m   \r\nFully Tiled with WHB, WC , bath & shower\r\n\r\nSunroom:\t \t4.51m x 4.44m\t  \r\nTiled floor, pellet stove heater, double door to rear patio\r\n\r\nOffice:\t\t\t3.04m x 2.40m.  \r\nWood floor\r\n\r\nBedroom One:  \t\t4.42m x 4.11m \r\nWood floor\r\nEnsuite:\t\t3.09m x 1.27m\r\nFully tiled with WHB, WC & shower\r\n\r\nBedroom Two:  \t3.93m x 4.34m\r\nWood floor\r\n\r\nBedroom Three:  \t3.22m x 3.81m\r\nWood floor\r\nEnsuite:  \t\t1.14m x 3.81m\r\nFully tiled with WHB, WC & shower\r\nWalk in Wardrobe:  \t3.65m x 2.90m\r\nWood floor\r\n\r\nBedroom 4:\t\t3.38m x 3.81m\r\nWood floor\r\n\r\nBathroom:\t\t2.81m x 2.49m \r\nFully tiled, WHB, WC bath & shower"
